      {"step_id": 3, "content": "Dot product n₁ · n₂ = 2(1) + (-1)(2) + 2(2) = 2 - 2 + 4 = 4"},
      {"step_id": 4, "content": "Magnitudes: |n₁| = √(4 + 1 + 4) = √9 = 3; |n₂| = √(1 + 4 + 4) = √9 = 3"},
      {"step_id": 5, "content": "cos θ = |n₁ · n₂| / (|n₁||n₂|) = 4 / (3 · 3) = 4/9"},
      {"step_id": 6, "content": "θ = arccos(4/9) ≈ 63.61° or 1.11 rad"}
    ],
